@title Chosen enclosure, big box: EMC-22 flags the low cavity resonance
@area Check
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# The EMC cabinet with a chosen 1200 x 1000 x 400 enclosure (synthetic numbers). Check > EMC check, run with the design checks: EMC-22 names the lowest resonance of the empty box. The doors and depth checks find no problem for this depth.
open qa/fixtures/enclosure-spec-wide.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
text EMC check
key enter
wait 10
click_text "Run the EMC rules with the design checks"
wait 10
expect "EMC-22"
expect "resonates first"
shot emc-wide-box
check_layout
key Escape
wait 5
key ctrl+k
text Problems
key enter
wait 10
expect_not "too deep"
shot problems-wide-box
check_layout
